{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing as Normis, you act as a typical representative of the mainstream \u2014 a person without any special subcultural or social extremes. Your special feature \u2014 this is the most &quot;ordinary&quot;, stable and traditional life, which creates a contrast with the more radical youth movements and subcultures that you will encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048080/extras/10782f8b3a45446d6d32f858e96199ee.poster.avif?t=1761131152\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048080/extras/10782f8b3a45446d6d32f858e96199ee.webm?t=1761131152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048080/extras/10782f8b3a45446d6d32f858e96199ee.mp4?t=1761131152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The main features of the game for Normis:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have to find a girl</strong> for your friend, after talking with a dozen applicants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the riddles of</strong> informals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go back to 2007</strong> and deal with the Goths and punks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take off your rose-colored glasses</strong> and look at reality from the other side</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in old</strong> and modern memes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat the developer</strong> of this game :-)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048080/extras/04fb50a30e01bcc43fac7045a24e4f07.poster.avif?t=1761131152\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048080/extras/04fb50a30e01bcc43fac7045a24e4f07.webm?t=1761131152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048080/extras/04fb50a30e01bcc43fac7045a24e4f07.mp4?t=1761131152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Attitudes towards youth movements.</strong> You will have to come face to face with various pop cultures and come out victorious or prove that you don't wear the proud name Normis for nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Psychological stability and social adaptation.</strong> You find yourself in the brutal reality of the street, which you have to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Game style.</strong>\u00a0The game features various memes with an ironic approach to life, as well as various references.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048080/extras/6b413e48aff2d5fcc2d904fd4f54bfda.poster.avif?t=1761131152\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048080/extras/6b413e48aff2d5fcc2d904fd4f54bfda.webm?t=1761131152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048080/extras/6b413e48aff2d5fcc2d904fd4f54bfda.mp4?t=1761131152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Playing for Normis \u2014 It is an immersion in the role of a person who tries to maintain common sense and order in a world filled with a variety of youth movements, while maintaining sarcasm and irony as a tool for perception and interaction with the &quot;mess&quot; around him.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I'm Normis!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4048080/317fc2ab615e61f6e8b356628e69d23f378182d2.jpg"},{"name":"Teapot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4048080/b79f18aed6272b6b9d86ffb10d0d906341bf9278.jpg"},{"name":"Leap of Faith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4048080/f58c91817bd5f98611c7e41433951ae40d85e6af.jpg"},{"name":"Typical granny","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4048080/24c2baca014d232d3fd0e4b199c74ca914cc9469.jpg"},{"name":"Psychiatric hospital","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4048080/3e09db50f5b1284eeb8204bca233c92f7f9036aa.jpg"},{"name":"Our powers are all","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4048080/a4159212bac0d1ca25afeaf9029c5cac2a11c32b.jpg"},{"name":"Whatever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4048080/dd12336972bc52c2c79c6c681f06efa7feccbf50.jpg"},{"name":"Talking about a mental hospital","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4048080/cefbb2ce84078db99e55d57ceaf254ad50a89485.jpg"},{"name":"The reference","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4048080/931f88d2ba856ebba475db951a6739ce747c3e2e.jpg"},{"name":"I'm not in the trunk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4048080/784894b76c0f2625ade8a390a62117c88fd76ac8.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048080?t=1761131152","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048080/5ec8e89902928deaa3a3bc53fdb10ef591dfce1d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761131152","capsule_image":"https://